    "L9 prepared the global zoo/finale infected cast and duplicate civilian roles. Use its authored future runner/Alpha set plus every resident override; retain all civilians/occupants and their own rendering path.",
    "Three r186 compileAsync omits shadow draws. Compile the actual shadow render objects asynchronously with the same HDR context before the unchanged real warm-up draws/fences.",
    "The 48-entry crowd cache could evict a selected Alpha during an asynchronous model load; the second lookup then chose an expensive runtime bake with no pending delivery. Hold the selected immutable CPU data across the load.",
    "L4 repeatedly sampled identical wheel-local tyre contacts and built separate paint graphs per retained vehicle LOD. Reuse exact samples and per-car paint, and load independent cars concurrently.",
    "Close civilian casters can be disabled at spawn. Warm their future shadow state and restore the gameplay flags; the repeated live L8/L9 shader guard records zero builds after loading.",
    "L10 WebGL uses 12 disjoint compile lanes instead of 6. All render variants, ordinary/instanced/solo warm-up draws and GPU fences remain."
